#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:15
msgid "G'Mic Settings"
msgstr "G'Mic instellingen"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:17
msgid ""
"G'Mic or GREYC's Magic for Image Computing is an opensource filter "
"framework. The G'Mic plugin for Krita exists only on Windows and Linux."
msgstr ""
"G'Mic of GREYC's Magic voor Afbeeldingenberekenen is een opensource "
"filterframework. De G'Mic plug-in voor Krita is alleen beschikbaar voor "
"Windows en Linux."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:19
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Krita has had G'Mic integration for a long time, but this is its most "
#| "stable incarnation. On Windows, the plugin is included in the installer "
#| "and Krita will find it automatically. On Linux, we are making an appimage "
#| "available for download."
msgid ""
"Krita has had G'Mic integration for a long time, but this is its most stable "
"incarnation. On Windows, the plugin is included in the installer and Krita "
"will find it automatically. On Linux, we are making an AppImage available "
"for download."
msgstr ""
"Krita heeft al heel lang G'Mic geïntegreerd, maar dit is zijn meest stabiele "
"soort. Bij Windows is de plug-in meegeleverd in het installatieprogramma en "
"Krita zal het automatisch vinden. Bij Linux stellen we een appimage "
"beschikbaar om te downloaden."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:21
msgid "You set it up as following:"
msgstr "U zet het als volgt op:"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:23
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Download the gmic-krita appimage."
msgid "Download the gmic-krita AppImage."
msgstr "Download de gmic-krita appimage."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:24
msgid "Make it executable."
msgstr "Maak het uitvoerbaar."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:25
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Configure Krita... --> G'Mic plugin` and "
"set G'MIC to the filepath there."
msgstr ""
"Ga naar :menuselection:`Instellingen --> Krita instellen... --> G'Mic-Qt-"
"integratie` en stel hier het pad in naar G'MIC."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:26
msgid "Then restart Krita."
msgstr "Herstart vervolgens Krita."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:30
msgid "Updates to G'Mic"
msgstr "Updates voor G'Mic"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:32
msgid ""
"There is a refresh button at the bottom of the G'Mic window that will update "
"your version. You will need an internet connection to download the latest "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Er is een verversing-knop onderaan het venster van G'Mic dat uw versie zal "
"updaten. U heeft een internet-verbinding nodig om de laatste versie te "
"kunnen downloaden."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:34
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "If you have issues downloading the update through the plugin, you can "
#| "also do it manually. If you are trying to update and get an error, copy "
#| "the URL that is displayed in the error dialog. It will be to a \".gmic\" "
#| "file. Download it from from your web browser and place the file in one of "
#| "the following directories."
msgid ""
"If you have issues downloading the update through the plugin, you can also "
"do it manually. If you are trying to update and get an error, copy the URL "
"that is displayed in the error dialog. It will be to a \".gmic\" file. "
"Download it from your web browser and place the file in one of the following "
"directories."
msgstr ""
"Als u problemen heeft met het downloaden van de update via de plugin, dan "
"kunt u dat ook handmatig doen. Als u probeert om up te daten en u krijgt een "
"foutmelding, kopieer dan de URL dat wordt getoond in in de foutmelding. dit "
"zal een \".gmic\"-bestand zijn. Download het via uw webbrowser en plaats het "
"bestand in een van de volgende mappen."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:36
msgid "Windows : %APPDATA%/gmic/update2XX.gmic"
msgstr "Windows : %APPDATA%/gmic/update2XX.gmic"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:37
msgid "Linux : $HOME/.config/gmic/update2XX.gmic"
msgstr "Linux : $HOME/.config/gmic/update2XX.gmic"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:39
msgid ""
"Load up the G'Mic plugin and press the refresh button for the version to "
"update."
msgstr ""
"Laad de G'Mic plugin en druk op de verversing-knop voor de versie waar u "
"naar wilt bijwerken."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/g_mic_settings.rst:43
msgid ""
"G'Mic is now included into Krita itself, and thus does not need to be "
"configured separately anymore."
msgstr ""
